    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66593" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταβολ-εύς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">έως</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one who exchanges</i> or <i>barters, trafficker,
			huckster</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπηλος, παλιγκάπηλος, μεταβολεύς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					25.46
				</span></i>
			, cf. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1156
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>interpreter, paraphraser</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν λέξεων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eust.
					1347.40
				</span></i>
			.</div>
